    ["GetTrainerServiceDescription(92)"] = "1: string Finishing move that causes damage over time, increased by your Attack Power.  Lasts longer per combo point:\r\n   1 point  : 105 damage over 8 secs\r\n   2 points: 151 damage over 10 secs\r\n   3 points: 207 damage over 12 secs\r\n   4 points: 270 damage over 14 secs\r\n   5 points: 342 damage over 16 secs",
